# Ignore everything by default
/*

# Keep these root files
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Keep only these folders
!Cryptography_Custom_lib/
!f446_CAN/
!f767_RNG/

# Keep contents inside them
!Cryptography_Custom_lib/**
!f446_CAN/**
!f767_RNG/**

# Ignore STM32CubeIDE generated files inside kept projects
**/.settings/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/build/
**/*.o
**/*.d
**/*.su
**/*.cyclo
**/*.elf
**/*.map
**/*.list
**/*.hex
**/*.bin
**/*.log
**/*.tmp

# Ignore workspace metadata
.metadata/

# OS/editor junk
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
